  "implementation": [
    "Concrete PreparedTiming reserves the actual final RunTiming pointee plus MAX_PROFILE_TIMINGS*sizeof((u8,u64)), checked, with zero ordered entries and one root. Private single-use reservation starts no clock.",
    "Start reserves before application.begin, performance.begin and accepted status clearing; actual Instant remains at the original clock-construction location. Rejection preserves old result/timing/configuration/token/history and leaves no new lease.",
    "Boxed-slice conversion provides exact admitted tuple capacity; clearing length followed by the unchanged existing cap prevents reallocation. State/Vec drop before the mandatory final guard. Existing GUI and executing Arc aliases share one charge.",
    "No clock/progress/scientific algorithms, public APIs, manifests, registration, schemas, native bindings or QML change. Production Worker stays byte-identical; no separate overlapping inline Worker/State/mutex/vector-handle charge.",
    "Existing second-Start result pressure includes both old and candidate timing and asserts genuine Worker dispatch. Request/result/queue/control fixtures use actual relevant budgets and retain their original scientific assertions."
  ],
